          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 67395,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>With buttons, programs change webpages based on user behavior. For example, clicking <em>Next</em> can run code that cycles through characters.</p><p>We'll learn how to write that code later. For now, we'll focus on the <code>button</code> element.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    touch-action: manipulation;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body style=&quot;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Choose Your Character&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;img height=180 id=&quot;character&quot;&#xA;   src='https://mimo.app/i/dan.png'&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;button&#xA;   onclick=&quot;previous()&quot;&gt;Previous&lt;/button&gt; &lt;button&#xA;   onclick=&quot;next()&quot;&gt;Next&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let currentIndex = 0;&#xA;   const images = ['https://mimo.app/i/dan.png',&#xA;    'https://mimo.app/i/jon.png'&#xA;   ];&#xA;   &#xA;   function next() {&#xA;    if (currentIndex &gt;= images.length - 1) {&#xA;     currentIndex = 0;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     currentIndex += 1;&#xA;    }&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;character&quot;).setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, images[&#xA;     currentIndex]);&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function previous() {&#xA;    if (currentIndex &lt;= 0) {&#xA;     currentIndex = images.length - 1;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     currentIndex -= 1;&#xA;    }&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;character&quot;).setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, images[&#xA;     currentIndex]);&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Buttons",
            "id": 67389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To create a button users can click on, we need the opening <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> and closing <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code> tags.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;p&gt;Subscribe to our Newsletter&lt;/p&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Subscribe&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To create a button users can click on, use opening <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> and closing <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code> tags.</p><p>Keep the newsletter sentence in a paragraph and make <code>Subscribe</code> a clickable button.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;p&gt;Subscribe to our Newsletter&lt;/p&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Subscribe&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h1&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h1&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;p&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, and finally <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Buttons",
            "id": 67391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can make texts appear on a button by typing them between the tags. Try typing <code>Login</code> between the button tags.</p><p>Make sure you use an uppercase <code>\"L\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h1&gt;Facebook&lt;/h1&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;p&gt;Log in to your account to get started&lt;/p&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Login&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"113\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>Login</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Elements between the tags ",
            "id": 67425,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Previously, we learned how to emphasize or make text important. We can also use these tags for the text inside a button.</p><p>Try typing <code>&lt;strong&gt;continue anyway&lt;/strong&gt;</code> between the button tags.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h3&gt;Warning&lt;/h3&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;p&gt;This site contains humor that may cause uncontrollable laughter.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;/p&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;&lt;strong&gt;continue anyway&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"137\" endIndex=\"169\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue anyway\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;strong&gt;continue anyway&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Previously, we learned how to emphasize or make text important. We can also use these tags for the text inside a button.</p><p>Make only <code>continue anyway</code> important in the warning button.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h3&gt;Warning&lt;/h3&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;p&gt;This site contains humor that may cause uncontrollable laughter.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;/p&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;&lt;strong&gt;continue anyway&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"137\" endIndex=\"169\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;em&gt;continue anyway&lt;/em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue anyway\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;strong&gt;continue anyway&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Buttons next to each other",
            "id": 67393,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buttons display next to each other even if they're on separate lines of code. Place these buttons displaying <code>First</code>, <code>Second</code>, then <code>Third</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;First&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Second&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Third&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>First</code>, followed by <code>Second</code>, and finally <code>Third</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buttons display next to each other even if they're on separate lines of code. Place these buttons displaying <code>First</code>, <code>Second</code>, then <code>Third</code>.</p><p>Keep their labels in that left-to-right order.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;First&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Second&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Third&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Fourth\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Last\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>First</code>, followed by <code>Second</code>, and finally <code>Third</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Buttons on top of each other",
            "id": 67402,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If we want buttons to stack on top of each other, we can use the <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> tag to place each button on a new line.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h3&gt;Stack of Pancakes&lt;/h3&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;p&gt;Log in or sign up to view the best photos of pancakes across the\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   globe.&lt;/p&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Login&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;br&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Sign up&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"171\" endIndex=\"172\" /><option startIndex=\"172\" endIndex=\"174\" /><option startIndex=\"174\" endIndex=\"175\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>, followed by <code>br</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If we want buttons to stack on top of each other, we can use the <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> tag to place each button on a new line.</p><p>Put Login and Sign up on separate lines.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h3&gt;Stack of Pancakes&lt;/h3&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;p&gt;Log in or sign up to view the best photos of pancakes across the\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   globe.&lt;/p&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Login&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;br&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Sign up&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"171\" endIndex=\"172\" /><option startIndex=\"172\" endIndex=\"174\" /><option startIndex=\"174\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"p\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"button\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>, followed by <code>br</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "*Question: Button tags",
            "id": 67443,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's wrong with this code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Click Bait&lt;button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The button's closing tag is missing a <code>/</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The text inside the <code>button</code> element has a space</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">There's a tag missing inside the <code>button</code> element</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nothing's wrong with the code</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The button's closing tag is missing a <code>/</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The final <code>button</code> tag is meant to close Click Bait. Which character is missing from that tag?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Click Bait&lt;button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A slash before button</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A space before Click Bait</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A second button element inside it</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nothing, opening tags close elements</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick A slash before button.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Text between the tags",
            "id": 67444,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h1&gt;Kit Kat&lt;/h1&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Give me a break!&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A button displaying <code>Give me a break!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A button displaying <code>Kit Kat</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A button displaying <code>Give me a break!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In the shown markup, which text appears inside the clickable control?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h1&gt;Kit Kat&lt;/h1&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Give me a break!&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Give me a break!</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kit Kat</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Both texts inside one button</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Give me a break!</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Elements between the tags",
            "id": 67445,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we place <code>&lt;em&gt;Add to Cart&lt;/em&gt;</code> in between opening and closing <code>button</code> tags?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A button with emphasized text displays on the webpage</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A button displays on a new line</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A button with emphasized text displays on the webpage.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A <code>button</code> contains <code>&lt;em&gt;Add to Cart&lt;/em&gt;</code>. What does a visitor see?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A button whose label is emphasized</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">An emphasized paragraph outside a button</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A button moved to a new line</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A button whose label is emphasized.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Buttons next to each other",
            "id": 67446,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Sign up&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Login&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">One button next to another button</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">One button underneath another</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">One button next to another button.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The two <code>button</code> elements are siblings with no line break between them. How do they appear?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Sign up&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Login&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Side by side</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">One below the other</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Merged into one button</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick Side by side.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Buttons on top of each other",
            "id": 67448,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which tag do we use to place one button underneath another?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which tag do we use to place one button underneath another?</p><p>Two button elements must appear one under the other. Which tag goes between them?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt;&lt;/button&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Button tags",
            "id": 67449,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the opening <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> tag.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h1&gt;Follow us on Twitter&lt;/h1&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Follow&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>, followed by <code>button</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make <code>Follow</code> a clickable button beneath the heading.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;html&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;h1&gt;Follow us on Twitter&lt;/h1&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &lt;button&gt;Follow&lt;/button&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" &lt;/body&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/html&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"p\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"h1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>, followed by <code>button</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, and finally <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
